item.text:
{
  "judgments": [
    {
      "issue_id": "region.ff59cef3f60ba95d922adc85",
      "disposition": "LAYOUT_RELATION_UNCERTAIN",
      "printed_text": "7-day annualised yield*: XX%\n1-day annualised yield*: XX%#\n30-day annualised yield*: XX%\nMost recent 1-year yield*: XX%",
      "explanation": "The page presents four columns, each with its own yield label and percentage placeholder. The # after the 1-day percentage is superscript. The listed locations cover repeated text in several columns, so this isolated deletion cannot establish which label–value pair was omitted or whether the text was relocated during extraction. The printed associations are clear and must be retained.",
      "affected_condition": "Each percentage belongs to its respective period heading. The asterisk refers to the computation basis and periods covered; the superscript # on the 1-day figure refers to the daily-update footnote."
    },
    {
      "issue_id": "region.fe9f83ef19e7ddba4bd6696b",
      "disposition": "LAYOUT_RELATION_UNCERTAIN",
      "printed_text": "7-day annualised yield*: XX%\n1-day annualised yield*: XX%#\n30-day annualised yield*: XX%\nMost recent 1-year yield*: XX%\n*Computation basis and periods covered:\n#For the most up-to-date daily figure, please refer to [www.xxx.com].",
      "explanation": "The inserted fragments correspond to visibly printed yield labels and placeholders. They are arranged in four columns, rather than as one continuous sentence. The # is printed as a superscript after the 1-day percentage and at the start of its footnote. Rendering that marker inline is typographic if its association is preserved. The supplied fragments do not establish whether the extraction preserves all four heading–value associations or merely changes reading order.",
      "affected_condition": "The daily-update footnote attaches specifically to the 1-day yield figure. All four yields carry the asterisk referring to their computation basis and periods."
    },
    {
      "issue_id": "region.61aa7c376126213b5f769e44",
      "disposition": "VISIBLE_TYPOGRAPHIC_DIFFERENCE",
      "printed_text": "excluding capital gain/loss",
      "explanation": "Each of the four computation-basis bullets visibly uses the intact word “excluding” in the phrase “excluding capital gain/loss”. Splitting that word into “exclud” and “ing” is an extraction segmentation difference; the supplied variants retain the same letters and do not change the exclusion.",
      "affected_condition": "The computation descriptions for the 7-day, 1-day, 30-day and most recent 1-year yields exclude capital gain/loss from net income."
    },
    {
      "issue_id": "region.e399b89340513c97a5a55049",
      "disposition": "VISIBLE_TYPOGRAPHIC_DIFFERENCE",
      "printed_text": "Most recent 1-year yield*: XX%\nMost recent 1-year yield is calculated by annualising the net income, excluding capital gain/loss, for the period from xx Aug 2022 to xx Aug 2023",
      "explanation": "Both the column heading and the computation bullet visibly print “1-year” with a hyphen. The difference between the tokens “1”, “-year” and the single token “1-year” is segmentation only. Neither the numeral nor the period unit changes.",
      "affected_condition": "The heading and computation bullet specify the most recent 1-year yield, with the printed computation period running from xx Aug 2022 to xx Aug 2023."
    },
    {
      "issue_id": "region.ec438b5e7a5419fe75c0a2f4",
      "disposition": "VISIBLE_TYPOGRAPHIC_DIFFERENCE",
      "printed_text": "Returns [(which are calculated based on change of NAV, [with/without] dividend reinvested)] of the immediately preceding 5 years:",
      "explanation": "The printed notes contain “NAV,” with a comma immediately following NAV. Both extraction variants preserve the word and comma; making the comma a separate token is typographic segmentation.",
      "affected_condition": "The notes describe returns calculated from change of NAV and retain the printed [with/without] dividend-reinvestment alternative."
    },
    {
      "issue_id": "region.69f1a8fdfd9b7cc04e38ab7a",
      "disposition": "VISIBLE_TYPOGRAPHIC_DIFFERENCE",
      "printed_text": "Returns [(which are calculated based on change of NAV, [with/without] dividend reinvested)] of the immediately preceding 5 years:",
      "explanation": "The page visibly prints “reinvested)]”: the closing parenthesis is followed by a closing square bracket. Both variants retain these characters in the same order. Separating the final square bracket into its own token does not omit or change text.",
      "affected_condition": "The closing punctuation ends the bracketed description of how the returns are calculated; the [with/without] alternative remains present."
    },
    {
      "issue_id": "region.10f696cafacfe70b111996c5",
      "disposition": "VISIBLE_TYPOGRAPHIC_DIFFERENCE",
      "printed_text": "54/F, One Island East, 18 Westlands Road, Quarry Bay, Hong Kong\n香港鰂魚涌華蘭路 18 號港島東中心 54 樓\n+852 2231 1222    www.sfc.hk\nPage 6 of 6",
      "explanation": "This text is visibly printed in the footer, with the page label at the lower right. The corresponding deletion issue contains the same footer at the beginning of the other extraction. Taken together, these differences indicate relocation in extracted reading order, plus spacing or tokenization differences around the Chinese address numerals, rather than newly printed content. The body occurrences of “of” included among the diagnostic locations are not part of this footer.",
      "affected_condition": null
    },
    {
      "issue_id": "region.da62006d72951d3f1a400124",
      "disposition": "VISIBLE_TYPOGRAPHIC_DIFFERENCE",
      "printed_text": "54/F, One Island East, 18 Westlands Road, Quarry Bay, Hong Kong\n香港鰂魚涌華蘭路 18 號港島東中心 54 樓\n+852 2231 1222    www.sfc.hk\nPage 6 of 6",
      "explanation": "The address, telephone number, website and printed page label appear at the bottom of the source page. The paired insertion issue restores the same text at the end of the other extraction. This is a footer reading-order difference, with Chinese spacing or tokenization differences, rather than a substantive deletion of the footer across the supplied comparison. The printed page label is “Page 6 of 6”, irrespective of the supplied image index.",
      "affected_condition": null
    },
    {
      "issue_id": "region.308ee8ef5d38cedf25fd4b46",
      "disposition": "VISIBLE_MISSING_OR_CHANGED_TEXT",
      "printed_text": "1.",
      "explanation": "The numeral and full stop are visibly printed before the first line of X placeholders under “Important notes and warning statements:”. The right-hand fragment omits this printed list label. This is an omission of text, even though it is a structural label and the associated statement is placeholder text.",
      "affected_condition": "Numbering of the first important note or warning statement; its substantive wording is not supplied by the placeholder."
    },
    {
      "issue_id": "region.1b147db227713656d1118e20",
      "disposition": "VISIBLE_MISSING_OR_CHANGED_TEXT",
      "printed_text": "2.",
      "explanation": "The numeral and full stop are visibly printed before the second line of X placeholders under “Important notes and warning statements:”. The right-hand fragment omits this printed list label. The omission removes structural text without revealing any substantive wording for the placeholder statement.",
      "affected_condition": "Numbering of the second important note or warning statement; its substantive wording is not supplied by the placeholder."
    },
    {
      "issue_id": "region.8ee2ad0c877c3bbf5b88c1a5",
      "disposition": "VISIBLE_MISSING_OR_CHANGED_TEXT",
      "printed_text": "3. Investment involves risk.",
      "explanation": "The page visibly labels “Investment involves risk.” as item 3. The supplied deletion removes “3.”, so this is missing printed text rather than a spacing difference. The identified change does not remove the risk-warning sentence itself.",
      "affected_condition": "The investment-risk warning is identified as item 3 in the printed list."
    },
    {
      "issue_id": "region.446dcf445a22972fef612d32",
      "disposition": "VISIBLE_MISSING_OR_CHANGED_TEXT",
      "printed_text": "4. The offering documents should be read for further details including the risk factors.",
      "explanation": "The page visibly labels the offering-document statement as item 4. The supplied deletion removes “4.”, which omits printed structural text. The identified change does not alter the wording directing readers to the offering documents and risk factors.",
      "affected_condition": "The statement about reading the offering documents, including the risk factors, is identified as item 4."
    }
  ],
  "remaining_questions": [
    "For the two yield-row issues, do the complete extractions preserve each of the four period headings with its own percentage, the computation-basis asterisk, and the superscript # attached specifically to the 1-day percentage? The supplied local fragments do not resolve relocation versus omission or misassociation."
  ]
}
